{"id":"javad-nasrin","name":"Javad Nasrin","type":"character","aliases":["Ondu relic hunter"],"description":"A relic hunter and the journal's author, who leads an expedition from Kabira to Turntimber to find the Seer's Sundial.","pages":2,"first_seen":"2009-10-02","last_seen":"2009-10-13","description_citations":[{"source":"wizards-archive","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Journal of Javad Nasrin","series":"Savor the Flavor","authors":[],"date":"2009-10-13","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/savor-flavor/journal-javad-nasrin-2009-10-13","link":"https://web.archive.org/web/20190812224059/https://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/savor-flavor/journal-javad-nasrin-2009-10-13","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20190812224059/https://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/savor-flavor/journal-javad-nasrin-2009-10-13","license":null,"text":"\"The Journal of Javad Nasrin\". Savor the Flavor, Wizards of the Coast, 13 Oct 2009. Archived by the Internet Archive."}],"bio":null,"timeline":[{"id":"savor-flavor-journal-javad-nasrin-2009-10-13-e0","era":null,"summary":"Javad's expedition sets out from Kabira with a hurda packbeast, hoping to reach Turntimber.","participants":["javad-nasrin","kabira","turntimber"],"location":"kabira","importance":"minor","page":"archive/savor-flavor-journal-javad-nasrin-2009-10-13","order":222,"story_date":"2009-10-13","storyline":"Zendikar","source":"wizards-archive","paragraph":0,"quote":"The sun was relentless all this first day, carving a searing line in the sky over the hedron-strewn flats of Agadeem, its disk like the gaze of an unshuttered eye.","link":"https://web.archive.org/web/20190812224059/https://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/savor-flavor/journal-javad-nasrin-2009-10-13#:~:text=The%20sun%20was%20relentless,of%20an%20unshuttered%20eye.","citation":{"source":"wizards-archive","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Journal of Javad Nasrin","series":"